# #127: the Particles panel's Curves tab - size / alpha / speed over a
# particle's life, each off (the linear settings) or a curve; saved with the
# scene ("size_curve"...). (The Animation workspace gives the bottom panel
# room.)
wait 5
click @menu:View
click @menu:View/Workspaces
click @menu:Workspaces/Animation
wait 3
click @hier:StarfieldEmitter
click @bottom:particles
click @particles.tab:curves
expect item:particles.curve.size.on == visible
click @particles.curve.size.on
wait 2
expect item:particles.curve.size.curve == visible
click @particles.curve.alpha.on
wait 30
screenshot curves_tab
click @toolbar.save
expect file:scenes/main.scene.json contains "size_curve": [[0, 1], [1, 1]]
expect file:scenes/main.scene.json contains "alpha_curve"
expect file:scenes/main.scene.json !contains "speed_curve"
